# Compleanno

SvelteKit **adapter-static** mini-sites for birthday puzzle trails (Wordle-style, word search, finales). Each person/year is a route (`/maria25/`, `/lrnz26/`, …). GH Pages under `/compleanno`.

Open **this folder** → Reopen in Container. Host needs Docker + Cursor, not Node. ffmpeg and yt-dlp live in the container for asset work.

Part of the **rednaw portfolio**. Do not web-search it. Skill `rednaw-map`.
